hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15854","Yazid narrated to us, he said: Yahya ibn Said informed us, from Abbad ibn Tamim, he informed him, from Uwaymir ibn Ashqar, that he slaughtered before the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, went out in the morning. When the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, prayed, that was mentioned to him, so he commanded him to repeat his sacrifice."
